# Scratch Pad from snacks
Space + . -- start a new
Sapce + S -- browse exisitng

# Replace Surroundings
Space + s + r + ' + " -- replace a '' with ""

Select a region first then + Space + s + a + ) -- wraps it in ()
Space + s + a + i + w + ) -- wraps it in ()

# Movements
g + e -- goes back to the end of last word

# Search
Space + s + w    -- start a snack grep with rigrep on this word
